/-!
# The intrinsic outer action of a quaternion central product

For the central product of two embedded quaternion eights, the automorphism
group has order 1152. Its action on the actual central quotient has the inner
automorphisms as kernel and image of order 72. These results are re-exported
from the descendant `Kernel` and `Lifts` modules.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, Lemma 14.2.21, printed p.988, PDF p.1005.
-/
